<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>MODIT | Materials that move your project</title>
    <meta name="description" content="MODIT is the Delhi NCR procurement operating system for building materials." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="home-page">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main>
      <section class="hero-wrap">
        <div class="container hero-new">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> DELHI NCR'S PROCUREMENT NETWORK</div>
            <h1>Every material.<br /><em>One intelligent flow.</em></h1>
            <p class="hero-lede">Source, compare and move construction materials with verified local supply, site-aware logistics and an AI copilot that does the chasing.</p>
            <div class="search-command">
              <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
              <input id="material-search" type="search" placeholder="What does your site need today?" aria-label="Search materials" />
              <button id="search-btn">Ask MODIT <span>↗</span></button>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-row"><span>✓ GST-ready invoices</span><span>✓ Verified suppliers</span><span>✓ Delivery to site</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Live material delivery visual">
            <div class="map-grid"></div>
            <div class="route route-one"></div><div class="route route-two"></div>
            <div class="map-pin pin-one"><b></b><small>Gurugram</small></div>
            <div class="map-pin pin-two"><b></b><small>Noida</small></div>
            <div class="map-pin pin-three"><b></b><small>Delhi</small></div>
            <div class="floating-order">
              <div class="order-top"><span class="tiny-logo">M</span><span>Live site order</span><b>•••</b></div>
              <div class="order-product"><span class="cement-bag">▦</span><div><strong>UltraTech Cement</strong><small>200 bags · Sector 65</small></div><em>ON TIME</em></div>
              <div class="order-progress"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              <div class="order-bottom"><span>Driver assigned</span><strong>ETA 42 min</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="deliver-pill"><span>↗</span><div><b>96.4%</b><small>on-time delivery</small></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ticker"><div><span>CONSTRUCTION, CONNECTED</span><i>◆</i><span>PRICES YOU CAN VERIFY</span><i>◆</i><span>SUPPLY YOU CAN RELY ON</span><i>◆</i><span>CONSTRUCTION, CONNECTED</span></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="container quick-section" id="categories">
        <div class="section-kicker">01 / EXPLORE</div>
        <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Built for every<br />stage of the build.</h2></div><p>From first pour to final fixture, get a complete material universe that understands how sites actually work.</p></div>
        <div class="category-grid">
          <% categories.slice(0, 8).forEach(function(category, index){ %>
            <a class="category-card category-<%= index %>" href="/agentic-ai?material=<%= encodeURIComponent(category.name) %>">
              <span class="category-number">0<%= index + 1 %></span><span class="category-symbol"><%= category.icon %></span>
              <h3><%= category.name %></h3><span class="round-arrow">↗</span>
            </a>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="dark-band">
        <div class="container how-grid">
          <div><div class="section-kicker lime">02 / HOW MODIT WORKS</div><h2>Less chasing.<br /><em>More building.</em></h2><p>MODIT connects the fragments of procurement into one dependable operating rhythm.</p><a class="text-link" href="/agentic-ai">Meet the AI copilot <span>→</span></a></div>
          <div class="flow-list">
            <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us what you need</h3><p>Type it, speak it, or upload a BOQ. MODIT structures every requirement.</p></div><b>↗</b></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Compare what matters</h3><p>Live price, stock, grade and delivery confidence—normalized across suppliers.</p></div><b>↗</b></article>
            <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Keep the site moving</h3><p>Order, invoice, track and reorder from one site command centre.</p></div><b>↗</b></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container supplier-section" id="network">
        <div class="network-intro"><div class="section-kicker">03 / THE NETWORK</div><h2>Local intelligence,<br />across <em>Delhi NCR.</em></h2><p>Match every requirement to the supplier who can deliver best—rather than the one you happen to know.</p><div class="network-stats"><div><strong>1,200<span>+</span></strong><small>verified suppliers</small></div><div><strong>18</strong><small>active delivery zones</small></div></div></div>
        <div class="supplier-stack">
          <% suppliers.slice(0,3).forEach(function(supplier, index){ %>
            <article class="supplier-row"><div class="supplier-rank">0<%= index + 1 %></div><div class="supplier-avatar"><%= supplier.name.charAt(0) %></div><div class="supplier-main"><h3><%= supplier.name %> <span>Verified</span></h3><p><%= supplier.city %> · <%= supplier.focus %></p></div><div class="supplier-data"><small>BEST QUOTE</small><strong><%= supplier.price %></strong></div><div class="supplier-data"><small>TO SITE</small><strong><%= supplier.delivery %></strong></div><div class="supplier-score">★ <%= supplier.rating %></div></article>
          <% }) %>
          <a class="all-suppliers" href="/agentic-ai">Find the right supplier for your site <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ai-banner"><div class="container ai-banner-inner"><div class="ai-orbit"><span>M</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div><div class="section-kicker lime">MODIT COPILOT / ALWAYS ON</div><h2>Procurement that<br />thinks <em>ahead.</em></h2></div><p>Your AI works through the repetitive work: reading BOQs, chasing quotes, surfacing trade-offs, and reminding the right person at the right time.</p><a class="circle-link" href="/agentic-ai">TRY THE<br />COPILOT <b>↗</b></a></div></section>

      <section class="container project-strip"><div><div class="section-kicker">FOR EVERYONE WHO BUILDS</div><h2>One platform.<br /><em>Many vantage points.</em></h2></div><div class="roles"><span>Contractors</span><span>Builders</span><span>Architects</span><span>Retailers</span><span>Suppliers</span><span>Site teams</span></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer><div class="container footer-inner"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>MODIT<small>PROCUREMENT OS</small></span></div><p>Materials that move your project.</p><span>Delhi NCR · 2026</span></div></footer>
    <script>document.getElementById('search-btn').addEventListener('click',()=>{const v=document.getElementById('material-search').value;location.href='/agentic-ai?material='+encodeURIComponent(v||'Building material requirement')})</script>
  </body>
</html>
